<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sara Lee cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sara Lee cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Hilliard Lyons analyst Wesley Roberts said on Thursday he cut his rating on Sara Lee Corp to hold from buy based on price appreciation.</p>
<p>-- Sara Lee shares were up 1/2 at 38-1/2, a new 52-week high in midday exchange trading.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Roberts said Sara Lee is an &quot;excellent company&quot; that continues to improve margins, cash flow and return on capital. However, he said the current share price reflects future growth prospects.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
